  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 104.02 Inspection and Copies of Records. Requests for access to records made pursuant to RSA 91-A:4 shall be submitted to the OPLC as required by Plc 104.\n\nSource. #8169, eff 9-21-04; ss by 9417, eff 3-14-09; ss by #14585, eff 6-1-26",
